2. Training-data attribution

The general-distillation corpus includes HPLT 3.0 Vietnamese web text,
Vietnamese Wikipedia text, user-generated text extracted from HPLT, and
unlabeled training-split text from UIT-VSFC, UIT-ViSFD, UIT-ABSA Restaurant,
UIT-ABSA Hotel, ViSpamReviews, ViNLI and PhoNER_COVID19.

HPLT 3.0:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/HPLT/HPLT3.0

UIT-ViSFD:
Luong Luc Phan et al. SA2SL: From Aspect-Based Sentiment Analysis to Social
Listening System for Business Intelligence. KSEM 2021, pages 647-658.
